OL,3,APrepare for supply chain disruption
OL,4,Afrom cyber or climate emergencies,
OL,5,AStreeting warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FMembers of the public and businesses
OL,8,Fneed to think more about how they would
OL,9,Fcope with natural disasters, cyber
OL,10,Fattacks or state-sponsored terrorism,
OL,11,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting says.
OL,13,FStreeting warned people needed to be
OL,14,Fmore aware of emerging risks facing the
OL,15,FUK and make plans to deal with them.
OL,17,FHe added that the government was
OL,18,Flaunching a "national resilience
OL,19,Fconversation" to raise awareness,
OL,20,Fincluding advice for households like
OL,21,Fstocking up on food, bottled water and
OL,22,Ffirst aid supplies.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
