OL,4,Afrom cyber or climate emergencies,
OL,5,AStreeting warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FLast month Environment Secretary Dame
OL,8,FAngela Eagle said people should prepare
OL,9,Ffor extreme weather as the strongest El
OL,10,FNino event in a generation develops
OL,11,Fover the Pacific Ocean.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
