OL,3,ARace to update services' computer
OL,4,Asystems after cyber-security flaw found
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisations and businesses are still
OL,7,Fscrambling to update their systems
OL,8,Fafter cyber-security flaws were
OL,9,Frevealed in a widely-used programming
OL,10,Flanguage, PHP.
OL,12,FWebsites around the world were taken
OL,13,Foffline on Wednesday and Thursday after
OL,14,Fthe developers of PHP said "critical
OL,15,Fvulnerabilities" were found in the
OL,16,Fback-end language, used in web
OL,17,Fdevelopment for decades.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
