OL,3,AGermany target of 'intensive'
OL,4,Aespionage, Merz says after suspected
OL,5,ARussian spy arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FGermany is the target of "intensive"
OL,8,Fespionage activity, Chancellor
OL,9,FFriedrich Merz has said after a
OL,10,FUkrainian national was arrested on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of spying for Russia.
OL,13,FOfficials said the suspect, named as
OL,14,FVadym Y., had allegedly collected
OL,15,Fmilitary-related intelligence from
OL,16,FGermany.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
