OL,3,AGermany target of 'intensive'
OL,4,Aespionage, Merz says after suspected
OL,5,ARussian spy arrest
OL,6,
OL,7,FMerz called the uncovering of the case
OL,8,Fa "success", but warned "let us not
OL,9,Fdelude ourselves - the activities of
OL,10,FRussian intelligence services in
OL,11,FGermany remain at a consistently high
OL,12,Flevel".
OL,14,FSeveral people alleged to be acting on
OL,15,Fbehalf of Russia and other foreign
OL,16,Fpowers have been arrested in Germany
OL,17,Fthis year. Germany has been one of the
OL,18,Fleading European suppliers of weapons
OL,19,Fto Ukraine since Russia's full-scale
OL,20,Finvasion in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
