OL,3,AAt least four dead after storm brings
OL,4,Aflooding to southern France
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least four people have died in
OL,7,FFrance, and one other has been injured,
OL,8,Fafter flooding caused by Storm Adam.
OL,10,FThe storm triggered widespread flooding
OL,11,Facross southern France on Tuesday,
OL,12,Finundating streets and disrupting
OL,13,Ftransport.
OL,15,FThe deaths included two women aged 86
OL,16,Fand 26 who were found drowned in a
OL,17,Fcellar in the Bouches-du-Rhone region.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
