OL,3,AAt least four dead after storm brings
OL,4,Aflooding to southern France
OL,5,
OL,6,FCorsica was also hit by severe weather.
OL,7,FLocal media reported that a 4x4 vehicle
OL,8,Fwas swept away by floodwaters on
OL,9,FTuesday - one of the occupants escaped
OL,10,Fthrough a window, but another man was
OL,11,Ffound dead. Authorities have not
OL,12,Freleased further details about the
OL,13,Ffourth death.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
